chezmoi dots pkg — Package and pinned release lifecycle

USAGE
  chezmoi dots pkg <command> [options]

COMMANDS
  status     Every tool: installed, pinned and latest versions
  bump       Update pinned versions and checksums in the source
  add        Add a package or pinned release to the source

ARGUMENTS
  command  status, bump or add; the command is the first argument after pkg.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots pkg status
  chezmoi dots pkg bump --dry-run
  chezmoi dots pkg add example-tool --brew
